en:
//【護氏】
<voice name='護氏' class='護氏' src='voice/md01/029vs0050a05'>
//「若造が。
//　何処の産か知らんが、腕相応に眼も養って
//おけというのだ」
"They weren't meant as praise, whelp. I'm saying that you should have cultivated wisdom as well as skill."

//【護氏】
<voice name='護氏' class='護氏' src='voice/md01/029vs0060a05'>
//「さすれば舞殿宮如きの飼い犬で一生を棒に
//振ることもなかったろうよ」
"Then you might not have tied your fate to that fool of a prince."

pt:
//【護氏】
<voice name='護氏' class='護氏' src='voice/md01/029vs0050a05'>
//「若造が。
//　何処の産か知らんが、腕相応に眼も養って
//おけというのだ」
"Não foi um elogio, fedelho. Estou dizendo que você deveria ter cultivado sabedoria junto com a técnica."

//【護氏】
<voice name='護氏' class='護氏' src='voice/md01/029vs0060a05'>
//「さすれば舞殿宮如きの飼い犬で一生を棒に
//振ることもなかったろうよ」
"Assim, talvez não tivesse atado seu destino a esse príncipe idiota."

en:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/029vs0070a00'>
//「生憎、眼力を養っていれば尚のこと、貴方
//のもとで禄を食む道は選べなかったであろう
//と存ずる」
"I fear that greater wisdom would provide me only with more reasons to reject your rule."

pt:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/029vs0070a00'>
//「生憎、眼力を養っていれば尚のこと、貴方
//のもとで禄を食む道は選べなかったであろう
//と存ずる」
"Temo que mais sabedoria só me daria mais motivos para rejeitar seu domínio."

