//　しかし敵も<RUBY text='さ'>然</RUBY>る者、いちいち巧妙に間を外す。
  I circle my enemy, looking for an opening. He maintains his distance with expert footwork. I can't get close.

//　戦闘経験では先方に分が有るせいか、埒が明かない。
  How do I outmaneuver an enemy with so much more experience?

pt:
