"......"

//【護氏】
<voice name='護氏' class='護氏' src='voice/md01/029vs0760a05'>
//「……」
"......"

//　調息し、時を計る。
//　闇雲な進出は応じ技の餌食。仕掛けるならば相手の
//出端か、逆に居付いて死に体となった瞬間か。
  I enter the breathing cycle and wait for my moment. To charge in blindly would be to invite his counter. I must wait for the enemy to begin his strike or to plant his feet and stop moving.

//　必ずどちらかの<RUBY text='チャンス'>機会</RUBY>は来る。
  Either way, the chance will surely come.

//　どちらだ――――
  Which will it―

